{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测 SSH 开启 X11 转发。对应需求：图形隧道/跳板。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux SSH X11转发","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nssh 命令行出现 -X/-Y 或 ForwardX11 相关选项。\n\n### 为何重要\n可转发图形会话、隐蔽通道或横向。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对源/目的地址、端口与是否加密隧道。\n3. 关联同主机前后外连、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://book.hacktricks.xyz/generic-methodologies-and-resources/tunneling-and-port-forwarding"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"29f0cf93-d17c-4b12-b4f3-a433800539fa","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 隧道或外连"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\") and\nprocess.name in (\"ssh\", \"sshd\") and process.args in (\"-X\", \"-Y\") and process.args_count >= 3 and\nprocess.parent.name in (\"bash\", \"dash\", \"ash\", \"sh\", \"tcsh\", \"csh\", \"zsh\", \"ksh\", \"fish\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1572","name":"Protocol Tunneling","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1572/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1021.004","name":"SSH","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}}],"false_positives":["管理员远程跑图形化运维工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","source.ip","destination.ip","network.direction","message"]},"version":110,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
